  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of line parallel to <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></math> through<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math><br /><br />If <math><mi>P&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be point of intersection of line and plane.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4ff4a7bf-a0c5-4393-b9d3-34de31ad134c-image.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 169px;\" /></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Coordinate points are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Required distance <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
